Animation Syncer Plus changes the original plugin implementation, animation
control validation, build configuration, manifests, and repository metadata.
It adds automatic nearby grouping, facial and sound timeline synchronization,
Penumbra redraw recovery, DJ sound exclusions, optional leading-frame matching,
position alignment adapted from the user's CoordMatch tool, a settings window,
release preparation, and validation checks.
